Intercepted --> Submitted: SaveBatch, POST /get_feed
Submitted --> Evaluated: evaluate_content()
Submitted --> OriginalRestored: server error
Evaluated --> Unchanged: no filter matched
Evaluated --> Selected: select_text_intervention()
Selected --> BlurMarked: 1 Modify Segments
Selected --> OverlayMarked: 2 Add Warning
Selected --> RewriteMarked: 3 Rewrite
Selected --> FallbackMarked: LLM error
BlurMarked --> Returned
OverlayMarked --> Returned
RewriteMarked --> Returned
FallbackMarked --> Returned
Unchanged --> Returned
Returned --> Rendered: CustomFeedReady, processMarkedText()
OriginalRestored --> Rendered: original passed through
Rendered --> Revealed: click warning overlay
Revealed --> Rendered: click again
Rendered --> [*]
